@startuml payment-overview
title Payment overview - happy path and retry after a failed payment

|Client (UI)|
start
:User chooses a payment method
and confirms the cart;
:POST /carts/{cart_id}/payments
header: User-Id
body: payment_method_id;

|API|
:Validate request, cart, payment method,
line items and stock
(see 02-start-payment);
:Reserve stock and save payment
as **pending**;
:Start the charge at the provider;

|Payment provider (mock)|
if (Charge request accepted?) then (yes)
  |API|
  :Respond **202 Accepted**
  with the pending payment;
else (no)
  |API|
  :Payment -> **failed** (with reason)
  Reserved stock is given back
  Cart stays **active**;
  :Respond with an error:
  **402** charge refused (e.g. invalid card)
  **502** provider unreachable or failed;
  |Client (UI)|
  :Show the error;
  :User can retry or change
  the payment method;
  stop
endif

|Client (UI)|
repeat
  :GET /carts/{cart_id}/payments/{payment_id}
  (see 04-get-payment-status);
repeat while (status is **pending**?) is (yes) not (no)

|Payment provider (mock)|
:Process the charge;
:POST /payments/webhook
(signed with the shared secret);

|API|
:Apply the result
(see 03-payment-webhook);
if (result?) then (succeeded)
  :Payment -> **succeeded**
  Cart -> **checked_out**;
else (failed)
  :Payment -> **failed** (with reason)
  Reserved stock is given back
  Cart stays **active**;
endif

|Client (UI)|
if (payment status?) then (succeeded)
  :Show order confirmation;
  stop
else (failed)
  :Show failure reason;
  :User can retry (same or
  other payment method);
  stop
endif

legend bottom
  Every request, database change and external call is saved
  in the logs table; every cart change is kept in carts_history.
endlegend
@enduml
